 function $f$ maps the set $X$ to the interval from $0$ to $3$ inclusive.\"*"] ["question-e8bbc308-2450-589f-b174-679c413f5f6e" :question/worked-solution "The sentence *\"The function $f$ maps the set $X$ to the interval from $0$ to $3$ inclusive\"* is equivalent to the following symbolic notation:\n\n$\\,$ $f:X\\to [0,3]$\n\nHere, the domain of $f$ is $X,$ and the codomain of $f$ is $[0,3].$"] ["question-e8bbc308-2450-589f-b174-679c413f5f6e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-502725af-4995-5bd6-9c6b-7a8e75264341" :answer-field/id #uuid "502725af-4995-5bd6-9c6b-7a8e75264341"] ["answer-7606deee-8e06-5017-9c79-13b72aeea418" :answer/id #uuid "7606deee-8e06-5017-9c79-13b72aeea418"] ["answer-7606deee-8e06-5017-9c79-13b72aeea418" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7606deee-8e06-5017-9c79-13b72aeea418" :answer/value "f:(0,3)\\to X"] ["answer-ef09d351-7752-5d6b-a5ca-f6313e5527c0" :answer/id #uuid "ef09d351-7752-5d6b-a5ca-f6313e5527c0"] ["answer-ef09d351-7752-5d6b-a5ca-f6313e5527c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ef09d351-7752-5d6b-a5ca-f6313e5527c0" :answer/value "f:X\\to (0,3)"] ["answer-c11a4975-eb7c-56b6-b878-768de0b61937" :answer/id #uuid "c11a4975-eb7c-56b6-b878-768de0b61937"] ["answer-c11a4975-eb7c-56b6-b878-768de0b61937" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c11a4975-eb7c-56b6-b878-768de0b61937" :answer/value "f:X\\to [0,3]"] ["answer-2c9b3f88-5053-5e6a-8cb8-272994ce7a20" :answer/id #uuid "2c9b3f88-5053-5e6a-8cb8-272994ce7a20"] ["answer-2c9b3f88-5053-5e6a-8cb8-272994ce7a20" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2c9b3f88-5053-5e6a-8cb8-272994ce7a20" :answer/value "f:X\\to \\{0,3\\}"] ["answer-3b69830b-65a2-5a91-b7c3-da955a137a3a" :answer/id #uuid "3b69830b-65a2-5a91-b7c3-da955a137a3a"] ["answer-3b69830b-65a2-5a91-b7c3-da955a137a3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3b69830b-65a2-5a91-b7c3-da955a137a3a" :answer/value "f:[0,3]\\to X"] ["answer-field-502725af-4995-5bd6-9c6b-7a8e75264341" :answer-field/key "selectio