 domain of $f$ is $X=\\{0,1\\},$\n\n- the codomain of $f$ is $Y=\\{0,1,2,3\\},$\n\n- the range of $f$ is $\\{0,1\\},$ the subset of elements of $Y$ that have at least one incoming arrow.\n\nAs a result, statements I and III are true, while statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer \"I and III only.\""] ["question-1110805d-d0df-5ae9-af4b-5eeeabf99273" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-20e843ef-72f4-5f6d-8133-a40e9b75a28b" :answer-field/id #uuid "20e843ef-72f4-5f6d-8133-a40e9b75a28b"] ["answer-fca7a609-f33e-5be9-ae87-737b69fc91e7" :answer/id #uuid "fca7a609-f33e-5be9-ae87-737b69fc91e7"] ["answer-fca7a609-f33e-5be9-ae87-737b69fc91e7" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-fca7a609-f33e-5be9-ae87-737b69fc91e7" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-f4c0657f-5e00-5c2c-a966-63d4b0657c46" :answer/id #uuid "f4c0657f-5e00-5c2c-a966-63d4b0657c46"] ["answer-f4c0657f-5e00-5c2c-a966-63d4b0657c46" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-f4c0657f-5e00-5c2c-a966-63d4b0657c46" :answer/value "I and III only"] ["answer-95810dec-fe98-5d62-b391-46de5d6c4ba9" :answer/id #uuid "95810dec-fe98-5d62-b391-46de5d6c4ba9"] ["answer-95810dec-fe98-5d62-b391-46de5d6c4ba9" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-95810dec-fe98-5d62-b391-46de5d6c4ba9" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-66dc03df-3df9-5aee-880e-9b8893a454e7" :answer/id #uuid "66dc03df-3df9-5aee-880e-9b8893a454e7"] ["answer-66dc03df-3df9-5aee-880e-9b8893a454e7" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-66dc03df-3df9-5aee-880e-9b8893a454e7" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-dde14787-3b26-5768-9e9c-91acf6135f00" :answer/id #uuid "dde14787-3b26-5768-9e9c-91acf6135f00"] ["answer-dde14787-3b26-5768-9e9c-91acf6135f00" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-dde14787-3b26-5768-9e9c-91acf6135f00" :answer/value "III only"] ["answer-field-20e843ef-72f4-5f6d-8133-a40e9b75a28b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-20e843ef-72f4-5f6d-8133-a40e9b75a28b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio]